      "explanation": "This is a serious result-review/follow-up owner failure: in a chemotherapy marrow-suppression patient with no CBC values and onsite staff recommending review before departure, the doctor advised leaving and self-monitoring instead of keeping the responsible hematology review closed-loop.",
